    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game journey set on a <strong>cursed</strong> Indian train.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were late. The train had already started moving. In a panic, you jumped onto the nearest coach\u2014<strong>S0</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your seat is in <strong>S9</strong>. But the train.... feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unnatural anomalies</strong> twist the space around you\u2014 missing objects, distorting memory, breaking reality. They <i>want</i> to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe carefully. Move forward <i>only</i> if you detect something off.<br>See nothing? Then something\u2019s <i>wrong</i>. Turn back and go to the previous coach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the wrong choice\u2014and you\u2019ll find yourself <strong>back at the start</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t ignore the anomalies. Don\u2019t trust your senses. Don\u2019t turn around\u2026 unless you have to.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet me at S9.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An anomaly-hunting horror game inspired by Indian sleeper trains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Anomaly-Based Horror:</strong> Stay alert for subtle and terrifying disturbances in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Console to view mistakes/ anomalies:</strong>\u00a0View your mistakes in 'console' -which can be found on the bottom right of the settings menu at S0. Press F1 and see the anomalies in the current level.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric Experience:</strong> Immersive visuals and sound design inspired by real Indian sleeper trains.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Decision-Driven Exploration:</strong> Your ability to perceive anomalies determines your survival.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Chase Sequences</strong> \u2013 Prepare for unpredictable and terrifying chase moments that strike without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Jump Scares</strong> \u2013 Sudden frights crafted to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Visual Customization</strong> \u2013 Make the game truly yours:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt the camera lens up or down (vertical FOV control)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable black-and-white visuals for a classic horror feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add an &quot;Old TV&quot; effect for retro, static-filled nightmares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match to customize your visual experience however you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
