redictable and terrifying chase moments that strike without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Jump Scares</strong> \u2013 Sudden frights crafted to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Visual Customization</strong> \u2013 Make the game truly yours:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt the camera lens up or down (vertical FOV control)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable black-and-white visuals for a classic horror feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add an &quot;Old TV&quot; effect for retro, static-filled nightmares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match to customize your visual experience however you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Traverse the sleeper coaches of an apparent empty Indian train\u2014or so it seems. If you see an anomaly, face it and move forward. If not, it may be a trick of the mind\u2014return to the previous coach. But beware, some anomalies will do everything to stop you. Face them or be lost forever.",
